# Codex proxy — exposes your ChatGPT Plus/Pro Codex quota as an OpenAI-compatible API.
# Sibling of dario (Claude proxy). Internal only; joined to dario.network as `codex`.

# Downstream auth key — every client (Open WebUI) must send this as its OpenAI API key.
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
CODEX_PROXY_API_KEY=CHANGEME_openssl_rand_hex_32
